  "note": "The source photos5/6 establish the permanent fluted mirror-glass shaft;8/9 establish the rooftop lattice masts and dishes. Wrong-city photo1, painted mural2 and photo4 taken FROM the roof are excluded. Roof183m follows the measured-building database, but185.5/186m and211m inclusive-antenna figures appear elsewhere; the antenna model is a documented visual estimate, not a resolved survey, and the CVU183m to-tip entry conflicts with the visible equipment and published211m total. The actual OSM tower centroid corrects the Wikipedia anchor by roughly70m. Short mapped facade returns remain pale vertical piers and deep grooves; long faces retain thin horizontal glass subdivisions, with coarser modules at far. Three lattice masts and a representative dish are estimates from current external photos. No rooftop adverts, hotel signs, antennas on neighboring roofs or skyline textures are copied. Geographic rotation is baked once from mapped controls. Cityscape: not tested. Full 3D world: not tested.",
